{
  "v": 2,
  "size": 256,
  "name": "Worldroot Hollow",
  "description": "Ancient woodland islands hide guarded clearings beside winding streams. Wade across pale shallows, skirt deep pools, and contest two corrupted roots. Both colonies have sheltered amber and timber; the northern Staglord and southern Matriarch guard legendary relics.",
